From 6b5f55bd95e9c412bafd1dbe1431032cd32baa20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5ec1cff <56485584+5ec1cff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 17:10:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(kernel): pin manager package name (#3868)

Relying solely on the signature to identify the manager is not a good
approach, as the manager might share its signature with other
applications. Pinning the manager's name resolves this issue while also
reducing the overhead associated with searching for the manager.
